WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Ferrara, in Italy.

2
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:05.090
A duke leads a visitor
down a quiet gallery,

3
00:00:05.140 --> 00:00:06.960
and stops at a curtain.

4
00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.000
His hand draws it back.

5
00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:12.790
"That's my last Duchess
painted on the wall," he says.

6
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:14.970
"Looking as if she were alive."

7
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.600
The visitor sits, and says nothing.

8
00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:20.560
He has come on business, sent by a Count.

9
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:23.450
The Duke is only talking about a painting.

10
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:25.600
So what is he really saying?

11
00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.530
In this mission, you'll see
who gets to look at her,

12
00:00:28.580 --> 00:00:30.100
and who decides.

13
00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:34.890
You'll find out why only the Duke
talks, to a listener who never speaks.

14
00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:39.020
And you'll hear what he complains
about: the way she smiled.

15
00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.190
Your mission: work out
what he's really saying.
